  "title": "My Family's Favorite Fresh Apple Cake",
  "description": "From an old family recipe found while cleaning out the homestead, this coffee cake sits atop a base of sliced fresh apples and is topped with a sweet cream cheese frosting.",
  "authors": [
    "Fivekiller1N"
  ],
  "date_published": "2010-11-25T19:54:47-05:00",
